      "role": "user",
      "content": "i mean yeah i get that, but everything else is totally normal. i just feel like i'm overreacting. if i just wait a day or two and see if it improves on its own, would that be okay? or is there like something i can take at home to help with the inflammation so i can just sleep it off for now?",
